BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (Customs takes about a week to review and then waives or examines, so examination time has to be built) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (into ship dates. The 7551 goes in after export with proof of export [6Ogi9iKVSTE @ 00:02:41]. Joe Harper's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (electronic rules are exact: file in ACE using the 10-digit HTS and matching units of measure, and upload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (supporting documents within 24 hours [NK99CBNOeJA @ 00:30:49]. The Scarbrough team reports a claim) Tj ET
