BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (lowers per-unit duty, and importers who moved sourcing out of China should switch from low-to-high to FIFO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm ([1_L7fnmAAU0 @ 00:32:02]. On substitution, J2 matching runs HTS-to-HTS off ACE data, claiming the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (highest duty first. Alex Neutloff shows why the matching engine matters. A greedy algorithm yields 11 where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (the optimal match yields 70. A 10-by-10 matching problem carries more possible combinations than there) Tj ET
