BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (tells claimants that a higher duty rate does not always produce a higher refund, because the lesser-of rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (bites.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (The unit economics are simple, and the practitioners publish them. Flexport offers two sizing methods: duty) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (spend multiplied by export share of sales, or export COGS multiplied by average duty rate [1_L7fnmAAU0) Tj ET
