BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (timing is the second variable. Accelerated payment lands in 4 to 6 weeks but requires a bond. Without it,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (refunds take 6 months to almost 3 years, because 'there are only like 25 drawback Specialists across the) Tj ET
