BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (a $300k claim needs a $300k bond. A continuous bond, by contrast, covers 10% of the amount. Flexport's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (instant drawback advances 70% in one day for a 2 to 10% advance fee. That fee depends on whether the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (claim has been approved for accelerated payment [1_L7fnmAAU0 @ 00:36:06]. Fees run on contingency,) Tj ET
