BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (Flexport's Tom Gould names flash title as the fastest way to lose a first sale claim: when both sales are set) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (up FOB Hong Kong and title moves on both at the same instant, customs has often ruled the middleman) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (never truly owned the goods, so working programs build in a separate title transfer to the middleman, even) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (one lasting less than a day, before the second transfer to the importer [yR_RXKhapxo @ 00:15:27].) Tj ET
