BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (and multilingual labels or certifications for several destination countries can let customs invalidate the claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (outright [yR_RXKhapxo @ 00:18:24]. Ask The Customs Manager supplies the inverse proof: factory-printed) Tj ET
