BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (incoterm looks clean, because incoterms do not settle ownership and title often transfers only after the boat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (is on the water [yR_RXKhapxo @ 00:44:21].) Tj ET
