BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (even when the middleman paid them, such as fabric the middleman hands the factory free, and Gould says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (this is exactly where companies get in trouble when no process feeds those numbers to the broker; a ruling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (on a representative transaction is no blanket shield either, because customs compares every later entry) Tj ET
